WEBVTT

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:26.750
<i>New days, it's the morning we begin. 
Let's give the world a kiss.</i>

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:35.240
<i>Blowing in the wind, with a little 
courage and love in our pockets.</i>

00:00:37.140 --> 00:00:44.090
<i>I wish: If only I had wings,</i>

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:53.690
<i>I could fly over the sadness, 
the past, and my doubts.</i>

00:00:53.690 --> 00:01:02.450
<i>Oh, yeah! There's nothing to lose. 
(Take whatever the brand new day brings.)</i>

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:07.290
<i>Take my way! I wanna catch a miracle...</i>

00:01:07.290 --> 00:01:11.030
<i>in the palm of my hand!</i>

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:19.720
<i>We're off on a journey through the endless 
earth, the skies, and the future.</i>

00:01:20.290 --> 00:01:32.140
<i>I know these newborn wings, oh! 
Are gonna gonna gonna shine someday!</i>

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:37.060
I realize this is sudden,

00:01:37.060 --> 00:01:38.490
but I require your assistance.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:40.310
Assistance?

00:01:44.700 --> 00:01:46.040
What's this for?

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:49.170
The young girl who is with you...

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.960
Cin? What about her?

00:01:52.630 --> 00:01:54.460
Kill that girl.

00:02:01.010 --> 00:02:06.060
"Nocturne of Bonds and Prayers"

00:02:07.350 --> 00:02:08.460
Shannon?

00:02:09.350 --> 00:02:11.480
Go check on Pacifica, all right?

00:02:11.480 --> 00:02:12.770
Pacifica?

00:02:13.280 --> 00:02:15.820
She'll be fine as long as she stays in here.

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:17.040
Shannon.

00:02:19.070 --> 00:02:20.320
I don't think you understand.

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:25.950
No, uh, I understand.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:29.540
I go look for Pacifica.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.510
Shannon, don't you think 
it's a little strange?

00:02:38.130 --> 00:02:39.720
Strange?

00:02:39.720 --> 00:02:42.890
I know you think the world of Cin, but...

00:02:42.890 --> 00:02:44.560
So do you, right?

00:02:46.390 --> 00:02:49.270
I wonder if she's a mutant?

00:02:51.060 --> 00:02:53.230
Maybe that's what happened 
when you brought her here.

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:57.610
If she used some sort of power on you, she...

00:02:58.320 --> 00:02:59.590
No way.

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:00.700
You're reading too much into it.

00:03:01.910 --> 00:03:03.660
I hope you're right.

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:09.960
W-What are you saying?

00:03:09.960 --> 00:03:11.570
Kill it.

00:03:11.570 --> 00:03:14.670
Thy brother and sister are of no use.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:17.590
That is why I am asking for thy help.

00:03:18.050 --> 00:03:20.220
Why do you want me to kill 
a little girl like...

00:03:20.220 --> 00:03:21.340
Because she is dangerous.

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:23.140
I don't understand!

00:03:28.220 --> 00:03:29.510
Cin...

00:03:30.480 --> 00:03:33.560
I cannot intervene. Hurry, kill it!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:34.860
You must be joking!

00:03:35.340 --> 00:03:38.220
Why should I do something like that?!

00:03:38.700 --> 00:03:39.910
Do it quickly.

00:03:39.910 --> 00:03:43.320
Otherwise, thy brother and sister will die.

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.040
Peace... maker...

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.460
Did you do that?

00:03:55.830 --> 00:03:59.340
Come on, say something. Cin!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:09.200
What are you doing?

00:04:12.270 --> 00:04:16.150
Thy brother and sister will die.

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:21.490
No, don't!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:29.870
Pacifica?!

00:04:37.540 --> 00:04:39.090
Are you all right, Cin?

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.050
Shannon?

00:04:47.010 --> 00:04:47.640
Apologize.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.270
Apologize to Cin.

00:04:52.730 --> 00:04:53.990
What?

00:04:54.850 --> 00:04:57.150
Why should I have to apologize?

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.020
Is Cin more important to you than me?

00:05:00.020 --> 00:05:04.400
Do you have any idea what you did to Cin?

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:05.990
I didn't do anything!

00:05:06.530 --> 00:05:08.820
Don't you trust me?

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:10.370
You protect me, huh?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:14.910
You just get full of yourself, talking 
big when it's convenient for you.

00:05:14.910 --> 00:05:16.340
Anyone will do!

00:05:16.340 --> 00:05:18.750
Just so long as you can feel 
superior by pitying something!

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:21.750
It doesn't have to be me! 
That's all you care about!

00:05:21.750 --> 00:05:22.980
Pacifica!

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:28.720
Is that what you think of me?

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:36.140
That's too bad, Highness.

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.640
Let's go, Cin.

00:05:50.820 --> 00:05:52.280
Why?

00:06:10.890 --> 00:06:14.560
It's awfully unusual for you two to 
have a drawn-out fight like this.

00:06:16.060 --> 00:06:18.160
You have to talk things out,

00:06:18.160 --> 00:06:19.560
especially at times like this.

00:06:20.560 --> 00:06:22.260
Raquel...

00:06:23.190 --> 00:06:26.620
Because Shannon doesn't know 
what to do about it, either.

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:34.580
Raquel, we need to talk.

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:35.900
Yes?

00:06:47.630 --> 00:06:49.220
What's the matter?

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.630
I'm going into town.

00:06:51.250 --> 00:06:52.950
We're getting rid of the cart.

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:55.390
Wait a minute, Shannon!

00:06:55.390 --> 00:06:57.810
Why would you do something important 
like that without talking to us?!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:06:59.350
We've already decided.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:03.140
We don't have any other choice.

00:07:12.490 --> 00:07:14.370
I'm sorry, Dragunov.

00:07:25.130 --> 00:07:29.840
Cin like Shannon, Raquel, and Pacifica.

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.590
That why I sad.

00:07:33.670 --> 00:07:34.670
Cin?

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:39.220
Shannon and Pacifica mad at each other now.

00:07:39.890 --> 00:07:42.770
Well, it happens sometimes.

00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:44.730
Because of Cin?

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:48.100
It's not your fault, Cin.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:50.570
I'm pretty sure we were all to blame.

00:07:52.570 --> 00:07:53.720
Say, Cin...

00:07:54.260 --> 00:07:56.660
Do you want to stay with us for good?

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:58.540
Want to stay.

00:07:59.870 --> 00:08:03.420
If you hang around us, you might get killed.

00:08:03.420 --> 00:08:05.330
Do you still want to?

00:08:05.330 --> 00:08:07.250
Cin not die.

00:08:07.250 --> 00:08:08.550
Well, the thing is...

00:08:08.870 --> 00:08:10.510
Cin not die.

00:08:11.370 --> 00:08:12.970
Oh, really?

00:08:16.800 --> 00:08:19.560
Well, it might take some time,

00:08:19.560 --> 00:08:20.930
but I think Pacifica will 
eventually come around.

00:08:22.680 --> 00:08:24.660
That's the kind of girl she is.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:36.240
Not much of a horse...

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.390
Pretty, aren't they?

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:08.360
I put meaning and prayers into 
each and every accessory I make.

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:10.200
This pretty.

00:09:11.020 --> 00:09:13.090
You have good taste!

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:15.560
Those are my personal favorite.

00:09:17.530 --> 00:09:18.870
Cut us a deal, okay?

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:23.830
Geez, those things cost a fortune...

00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.420
Pacifica!

00:09:29.420 --> 00:09:30.630
Give flower!

00:09:46.770 --> 00:09:47.520
Shannon?

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:51.480
Shannon! Shannon!

00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:53.480
Shannon!

00:10:02.280 --> 00:10:03.540
Hey.

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.510
What do you mean, "Hey"?

00:10:05.510 --> 00:10:07.500
How did you get hurt?!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:13.460
So, Cin, what happened?

00:10:14.170 --> 00:10:15.590
Will you tell me?

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.800
Why are you keeping quiet?

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:24.770
It's hard to imagine Shannon getting hurt.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:29.690
It was you.

00:10:29.690 --> 00:10:30.980
It's because you were with him.

00:10:30.980 --> 00:10:31.940
Pacifica.

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.600
I sorry.

00:10:45.580 --> 00:10:46.790
What's this?

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:48.620
It Pacifica's.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:54.000
Of all the stupid...

00:10:54.000 --> 00:10:56.050
He wants to use these to make up with me?

00:10:56.420 --> 00:10:59.050
He didn't put much thought into it...

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.770
Do you like them?

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:13.480
Cin picked those out for you.

00:11:13.480 --> 00:11:16.110
The lady said they have 
prayers of bonds in them.

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.700
Prayers that we would always be together.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.020
That even if we were separated,

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:23.150
we would eventually be reunited.

00:11:30.710 --> 00:11:33.750
Pacifica... I'm sorry.

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:37.130
Thanks.

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:51.560
Where's Cin?

00:11:51.560 --> 00:11:52.890
She isn't with you?

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:05.820
I'm not picking up anything nearby.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:08.870
Where are you going?

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:11.870
Where else? To go look for her!

00:12:11.870 --> 00:12:13.270
Are you sure?

00:12:16.420 --> 00:12:21.010
I wonder if I'll turn out to be 
a big sister like you, Raquel.

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:27.930
Cin! Where are you?!

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:31.180
Where are you?! Cin!

00:12:35.850 --> 00:12:38.730
What a sorry sight you are, my master.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:40.730
Zefiris?

00:12:41.400 --> 00:12:43.860
I have had difficulties of my own.

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:46.850
I managed to manifest on this side earlier,

00:12:46.850 --> 00:12:48.330
but there was interference.

00:12:48.330 --> 00:12:49.990
Interference?

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.700
I have been unable to so 
much as speak with you

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:55.220
unless you are a certain 
distance away from that girl.

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:58.520
Wait, you know about Cin?

00:12:58.520 --> 00:13:02.380
Of course. That girl's 
original designation is Cz.

00:13:03.050 --> 00:13:05.550
She is an Artillery-type Peacemaker.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:13.180
Cin!

00:13:15.060 --> 00:13:16.480
Cin! Where are you?

00:13:16.780 --> 00:13:18.230
Cin!

00:13:19.440 --> 00:13:20.940
Cin?!

00:13:22.410 --> 00:13:24.530
Hey! Come back!

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.000
Gotcha!

00:13:36.000 --> 00:13:38.080
I finally caught you...

00:13:40.790 --> 00:13:44.210
Um... I'm not sure what to say.

00:13:44.210 --> 00:13:45.760
I, uh...

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.470
I'm sorry. I was a jerk.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.430
You don't have to leave.

00:13:53.140 --> 00:13:58.230
We lead pretty complicated lives as it is.

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.440
Adding one more weird person 
won't change anything.

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:02.400
But...

00:14:02.800 --> 00:14:06.280
From now on, call me "big sister," okay?

00:14:06.280 --> 00:14:06.900
Okay?

00:14:08.410 --> 00:14:09.800
Big sister?

00:14:21.270 --> 00:14:22.590
Let's stay together.

00:14:22.950 --> 00:14:24.110
That's a promise, okay?

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:32.440
C'mon, don't cry.

00:14:33.600 --> 00:14:35.380
Let's go home, okay?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.480
I'm sorry to interrupt...

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.940
But I'll take that child 
back, if you don't mind.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:45.030
Who are you?

00:14:45.030 --> 00:14:48.950
Me? Peacemaker Steyr Civilian.

00:14:50.360 --> 00:14:52.130
Peacemaker?

00:14:52.740 --> 00:14:56.160
Humans cannot defy the will of a Peacemaker.

00:14:56.620 --> 00:14:59.710
Pacifica Cassul is the lone exception,

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:05.960
but at present, that property only manifests 
at times of extreme fear or anger.

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:10.980
It is for that reason that you 
were unable to defy Cz's will.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.800
What are you talking about?

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:16.390
If Cz had awakened to her true form,

00:15:16.390 --> 00:15:19.230
she probably would have killed 
all of you immediately.

00:15:19.230 --> 00:15:23.810
But as long as she retains the 
human attributes of her avatar,

00:15:23.810 --> 00:15:25.360
I am unable to touch her.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:30.530
I proposed to Pacifica Cassul 
that she eliminate Cz,

00:15:30.530 --> 00:15:32.820
but it would seem that she did not do so.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.250
I had no choice.

00:15:35.250 --> 00:15:37.080
That thing was too dangerous.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:38.830
Cin isn't like that!

00:15:39.270 --> 00:15:42.540
Those emotions are being 
manipulated by Cz, as well.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.420
You're wrong! You're wrong...

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.550
I'm acting of my own free will.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:53.680
My master, we can speak later.

00:15:53.680 --> 00:15:56.470
It would seem that another 
Peacemaker is here.

00:15:56.780 --> 00:15:59.460
It is with Cz and your younger sister.

00:16:00.930 --> 00:16:03.380
To be honest, I'm surprised.

00:16:03.380 --> 00:16:06.400
I can't believe she was found by you people.

00:16:06.900 --> 00:16:09.860
That girl is one of us.

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.240
Shall I explain?

00:16:13.860 --> 00:16:17.490
Peacemakers are set up to work in pairs.

00:16:17.490 --> 00:16:22.040
The Artillery-types are typically 
too powerful and difficult to use,

00:16:22.040 --> 00:16:25.960
so they were kept stored in a compressed 
state in phase-shift space.

00:16:26.920 --> 00:16:31.420
We had begun uncompression operations on 
them to have them fight against Zefiris.

00:16:31.420 --> 00:16:33.930
W-What are you talking about?

00:16:34.590 --> 00:16:37.740
That girl's counterpart, Galil, got careless

00:16:37.740 --> 00:16:40.970
and was destroyed by you people,

00:16:40.970 --> 00:16:43.940
so after she was uncompressed, 
she was tossed out

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:46.480
into the world without 
knowing what was going on.

00:16:46.980 --> 00:16:48.180
I wasn't left with much choice,

00:16:48.180 --> 00:16:50.980
so I came looking for her in his place.

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.450
Come to me, Cz.

00:16:55.030 --> 00:16:57.070
That girl is your enemy, remember?

00:16:57.070 --> 00:17:00.080
Why don't you ask what <i>she </i>wants?!

00:17:00.080 --> 00:17:01.910
That doesn't really matter.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:05.420
Cin, run! Hurry!

00:17:12.550 --> 00:17:16.680
Come now, return to your proper form.

00:17:23.600 --> 00:17:24.720
Cin?!

00:17:26.350 --> 00:17:27.400
Big sister!

00:17:27.400 --> 00:17:28.350
Cin!

00:17:28.860 --> 00:17:31.230
Big sister!

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:49.580
How do you feel, Cz?

00:17:51.340 --> 00:17:52.750
Steyr?

00:17:52.750 --> 00:17:56.590
This must mean that my counterpart, 
Galil, has been killed.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.970
Yes, I hate to say. By him.

00:18:00.290 --> 00:18:01.740
Pacifica!

00:18:02.970 --> 00:18:05.600
Big brother! Big sister!

00:18:05.600 --> 00:18:06.810
Pacifica!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:07.940
Where's Cin?

00:18:07.940 --> 00:18:09.310
I don't know!

00:18:10.020 --> 00:18:10.960
Who are they?

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.150
I don't know!

00:18:12.860 --> 00:18:15.940
Hey, you! Where did Cin go?!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.110
As you can see,

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.700
she is now our enemy.

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:22.660
I can't... I can't accept that!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:28.160
My master, I will now borrow your body.

00:18:40.930 --> 00:18:42.100
Pacifica!

00:18:44.100 --> 00:18:45.090
Be careful.

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.620
Zefiris has already fused with her D-Knight.

00:18:49.190 --> 00:18:51.600
Still, her restoration is incomplete.

00:18:52.370 --> 00:18:55.480
There are gaps in her mental 
unification with the D-Knight.

00:18:56.130 --> 00:18:57.320
You're in the same shape.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:19:01.780
I doubt you were fine-tuned immediately 
after you were uncompressed.

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:05.870
If you overexert yourself, there's 
a possibility of atomic collapse.

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.200
I don't need to go to the 
trouble of destroying you.

00:19:08.200 --> 00:19:09.760
Possibly.

00:19:09.760 --> 00:19:13.880
But maybe I can take you with me when I go.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:15.940
Care to give it a try?

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:25.700
Sorry, but I have no intention 
of fighting today.

00:19:26.350 --> 00:19:27.980
Let's go, Cz.

00:19:29.180 --> 00:19:29.810
You're not getting away!

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.390
You have my word.

00:19:36.980 --> 00:19:41.510
The next time we meet, I'll destroy you.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.110
According to Zefiris,

00:20:20.900 --> 00:20:27.440
there's almost no chance that any of 
Cin's personality remains inside Cz.

00:20:28.870 --> 00:20:31.940
She also said that the next time we meet,

00:20:31.940 --> 00:20:34.750
we'll really try to kill each other.

00:20:35.480 --> 00:20:38.870
Do you really think there's no way 
to turn her back to her old self?

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.840
I thought I had a little sister...

00:20:43.810 --> 00:20:48.040
I thought it might be nice 
to act like a big sister...

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:53.480
Just when I was finally 
getting used to the idea...

00:21:16.580 --> 00:21:21.730
<i>A blessing of rain falls quietly. (Falls.)</i>

00:21:21.730 --> 00:21:27.050
<i>Droplets of my love, 
which fall for someone...</i>

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:34.230
<i>who is still waiting in a land far away.</i>

00:21:34.230 --> 00:21:40.020
<i>The morning wind blows, caressing 
my cheek. (What was that...)</i>

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:45.150
<i>Did you feel something, feel something 
just now? (...on my cheek?)</i>

00:21:45.150 --> 00:21:48.320
<i>It goes up to the one and only sky... 
(More certain than anything.)</i>

00:21:48.320 --> 00:21:53.370
<i>a sky which has a fixed, certain meaning.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:59.920
<i>I come to a stop in the shadow 
of clouds that chase after me.</i>

00:21:59.920 --> 00:22:03.380
<i>This journey of the heart 
that I wish to gaze upon...</i>

00:22:03.380 --> 00:22:06.590
<i>goes on forever and goes on forever.</i>

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:13.220
<i>One day I will chance upon the 
voice I've not heard in so long.</i>

00:22:13.220 --> 00:22:15.180
<i>Alainn la-li-la.</i>

00:22:15.180 --> 00:22:19.900
<i>At last the ship sets sail, sets sail. 
(The ship glides on forever...)</i>

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:25.190
<i>Yes, believe in this wide world... 
(...to the edge of seas unknown.)</i>

00:22:25.190 --> 00:22:28.530
<i>and go off into the distance.</i>

00:22:28.530 --> 00:22:32.630
<i>And onwards into the future.</i>

00:22:33.410 --> 00:22:46.460
"Next Time"

00:22:34.490 --> 00:22:36.630
Traveling a snowy road,

00:22:36.630 --> 00:22:39.300
Pacifica and the others stumble 
across a village hidden by magic.

00:22:39.300 --> 00:22:43.250
The people who come out don't seem 
to be very happy to see them.

00:22:43.250 --> 00:22:45.170
Maybe they don't like people.

00:22:45.170 --> 00:22:47.060
Next time on <i>Scrapped Princess</i>,

00:22:47.060 --> 00:22:49.030
"Requiem for the Heretics."

00:22:49.030 --> 00:22:50.430
Please tune in!
